            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2、【2024年武汉工程大学2.2】 \\( f(t)=e^{-t}\\delta(t) \\) ，其导数 \\( \\frac{df(t)}{dt} \\) 为____，积分 \\( \\int_{-\\infty}^{t}f(\\tau)d\\tau \\) 为____。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.197,
                0.191,
                0.479,
                0.234
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "解: \\( f(t) = e^{-t} \\delta (t) = \\delta (t) \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.255,
                0.236,
                0.422,
                0.279
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "故  \\( \\frac{d f(t)}{dt} = \\delta'(t) \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.283,
                0.296,
                0.58,
                0.337
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f (\\tau) d \\tau = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} \\sqrt {\\tau} d \\tau = u (t)\n\\]"
        },
