        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.195,
                0.181,
                0.422,
                0.203
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3) \\(\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} e^{-j\\omega t} \\delta'(t) dt =\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.163,
                0.206,
                0.661,
                0.261
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "解：(1)  \\( f_{0}|t|=\\frac{u|t|-u|-t|}{2} \\)  从同称为有  \\( \\frac{1}{2}\\sin u|t| \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.211,
                0.274,
                0.69,
                0.308
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2)  \\( \\sin t = 0 \\)  的根为  \\( t = k\\pi \\) ,  \\( k = 0, \\pm1, \\pm2 \\cdots \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.261,
                0.316,
                0.402,
                0.354
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n(\\sin t) ^ {\\prime} = \\cos t\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.272,
                0.362,
                0.703,
                0.507
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{原式}} & {= \\sum \\frac {1}{| \\cos k \\pi |} \\delta (t - k \\pi)} \\\\ & {= \\sum \\delta (t - k \\pi), k = 0, \\pm 1, \\pm 2 \\dots} \\\\ & {= \\dots + \\delta (t + \\pi) + \\delta (t) + \\delta (t - \\pi) + \\delta (t - 2 \\pi) + \\dots} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.201,
                0.513,
                0.76,
                0.561
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3) 原式 =  \\( -\\left[e^{-j\\omega t}\\right]_{t=0}^{1} \\)  =  \\( -\\left[-j\\omega e^{-j\\omega t}\\right]_{t=0} \\)  = jW",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
