            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.183,
                0.109,
                0.811,
                0.15
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5、【2024年湖北工业大学1】已知  \\( x(4+2t)=\\delta(t)+e^{-2t-4} \\) ，求：（关注通信考研小马哥，通信考研不迷路）",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.194,
                0.158,
                0.276,
                0.175
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1) \\(x(t)\\);",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.195,
                0.183,
                0.335,
                0.202
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) 求 \\(\\int_{0}^{\\infty} x(t) dt\\)。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.181,
                0.213,
                0.426,
                0.256
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "解：(1) 法一：数学强",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.211,
                0.253,
                0.471,
                0.293
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "令 \\( a = 4 + {2t} \\) ,则 \\( t = \\( \\frac{a - 4}{2} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.214,
                0.294,
                0.43,
                0.33
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nx (a) = \\sqrt {(\\frac {a - 4}{2})} + e ^ {- a}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.194,
                0.336,
                0.451,
                0.375
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "即 \\( x(t) = \\delta(\\frac{t}{2} - 2) + e^{-t} \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.547,
                0.208,
                0.755,
                0.244
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "第三：运算视角",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.551,
                0.24,
                0.932,
                0.36
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {x (4 + x t)} & {\\xrightarrow {t \\to \\frac {t}{2}} x (4 + 2 \\cdot \\frac {t}{2})} \\\\ & {\\longrightarrow = x (4 + t)} \\\\ & {\\stackrel {1 1} {\\delta (\\frac {t}{2}) + e ^ {- t - 4}}} \\\\ & {= 2 \\delta (t) + e ^ {- t - 4}} \\end{array} \\quad \\begin{array}{r l} {t \\to t - 4} & {= x [ 4 + (t - 4 ]} \\\\ & {= x (t)} \\\\ & {\\downarrow} \\\\ & {\\longrightarrow 2 \\delta (t - 4) e ^ {- t}} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.201,
                0.385,
                0.462,
                0.419
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\nx (t) = 2 \\sqrt {(t - 4)} + e ^ {- t}\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.2,
                0.439,
                0.651,
                0.617
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{r l} {(2)} & {\\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} x (t) d t = 2 \\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (t - 4) d t + \\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} e ^ {- t} d t} \\\\ & {\\qquad = 2 + [ - e ^ {- t} ] _ {0} ^ {\\infty}} \\\\ & {\\qquad = 2 + [ 0 + 1 ]} \\\\ & {\\qquad = 3} \\end{array}\n\\]"
        },
